{"id":"n14593-1-5","stage":3,"title":"어쩐지 · 不知怎的","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14593-1-5-1","ko":"우리 같은 반이었던 거 기억 안 나?","zh":"你不记得我们以前是同一个班的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"같은","meaning":"相同，一样，一致","explanation":"같다：相同，一样，一致；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"1","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"반이었던","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반이었던","audio":"/audio/45d9722f311c16da311b.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，把前面的修饰内容概括为事物、行为或情况。这里不表示指示代词“那个”；具体的时态、疑问或推测语气结合前后的语尾理解。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"기억","meaning":"记着，记住","explanation":"기억：记着，记住","readings":[{"term":"기억","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38812","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기억","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"나?","meaning":"想起，想到","explanation":"나다：想起，想到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"21","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相同，一样，一致","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"彼此并无差异。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"9f12e26e8d4c016a","term":"반","zh":"班，班级","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3","entryId":"57301","definition":"学校里把一个年级以教室为单位划分的团体。","pronunciation":["반"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"603669bd762779d9","term":"기억","zh":"记着，记住","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3","entryId":"38812","definition":"不忘记或重新想起以前的模样、事实、知识、经验等。","pronunciation":["기억"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"想起，想到","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"想法或记忆等浮现。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f39938c1ec9d7aa31f15.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14593-1-5-2","ko":"아, 어쩐지 낯이 있다 했어.","zh":"啊，难怪我觉得你面熟呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4